WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:05.590
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, I'm Jan and in
this video I'm revealing Trolls World Tour's

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:09.179
hilarious deleted ending with the Bergens
Bridget and Gristle

00:00:09.179 --> 00:00:13.490
plus 14 more amazing deleted scenes and songs
you never got to see!

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.230
As the credits roll on the final version of
Trolls World Tour, we get a fun dance party

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.520
and song that finishes with a cool cameo by
everyone's favourite Bergens, Bridget and

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.520
Gristle.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.210
But there's an arguably even funnier post-credits
scene that we almost got:

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.140
"Poppy come quick!"

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:36.010
"Cloud Guy what is it?"

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:40.829
"I'm having a... a baby!"

00:00:40.829 --> 00:00:47.030
These are the three Cloud babies we see riding
along with Cloud Guy and his girlfriend in

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.030
the credits of the final movie.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:52.730
And, of course, the cut scene is also a fun
riff on how Guy Diamond gives birth to Tiny

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:53.730
Diamond.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:54.730
"Poppy, come quick!

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:55.730
It's an emergency!"

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:56.960
"Guy Diamond, what's wrong?"

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.780
"I'm having a baby!"

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:04.949
The deleted credits scene continues in the
vein of a cheesy family-based TV sitcom complete

00:01:04.949 --> 00:01:08.250
with canned laughter, as we see Cloud Guy
trying to take care of his kids.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.719
♪ Love is to be in every moment.

00:01:12.719 --> 00:01:16.950
♪
♪ La la la la laaa ♪

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:21.840
♪ Love is enjoying the passage of time ♪
♪ Love is living up on Cloud 9! ♪

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:22.840
"Mew."

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.310
"What the heck's this sack of garbage?"

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.310
"Yaaay!"

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:26.310
"Urgh.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:27.310
No thank you!"

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.880
And that hilarious ending with Bridget and
Gristle watching the show on TV might well

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:35.590
have been another Bergen cameo, appearing
right at the very end of the credits, in addition

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.540
to the mid-credits scene we got in the final
movie:

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.890
"Aw, Grissy, I guess we're late to the party."

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:43.890
"Aw, balls!"

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:44.890
"Grissy."

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.470
"But who's gonna eat my cheese balls, babe?"

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:51.090
The first trailer for Trolls World Tour features
a scene cut from the final movie of Poppy

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.579
singing The Sound of Silence together with
the same weird and wonderful forest creatures

00:01:55.579 --> 00:02:07.820
that accompanied her when she sang the song
in the first Trolls film.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:12.780
According to the Trolls World Tour wiki, this
deleted scene of Barb crashing Poppy's song

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.640
was how the movie was originally going to
begin.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.360
And instead of Barb's pet bat Debbie delivering
an invitation to Queen Poppy, this was going

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:59.310
to be how Poppy discovered that there were
other Troll tribes.

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:04.380
Cloud Guy had a relatively small part in Trolls
World Tour, just narrating the opening scene

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:08.730
and briefly dancing on stage with the other
Trolls at Barb's concert.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:12.540
Originally though, there was a deleted scene
in which Poppy, Branch, Biggie and Dinkles

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.160
bump into him again.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.580
"Cloud guy!"

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.000
"Cloud guy."

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.000
"Slappy!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.000
Broppy pants.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.460
Hey... fist bump?

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.000
Old time's sake?"

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.000
"No."

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.150
That would have been a call-back to when Cloud
Guy pranked Branch in the first movie:

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:28.660
"I'm gonna let you slide with a fist bump.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.660
Shark attack!

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:30.660
Nom-nom-nom-nom.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:33.870
Jellyfish!"

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:38.500
In the cut scene, Cloud Guy would have also
introduced us to his new girlfriend.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.920
"Guys, this is...

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.920
Janet.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.340
We're dating!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.870
Janet and Cloud Guy, J-Loud Guy.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:46.870
That's our couple name."

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.610
Janet does make a brief appearance in the
end credits of the final movie where the two

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:54.800
clouds already seem to be acquainted and give
each other engagement rings, which makes a

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.540
little more sense now we've seen this missing
moment.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.240
"How long have you guys known each other?"

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:00.240
"Ten minutes.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.240
And we're going to last forever!"

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.340
"Woh, slow your roll Romeo.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.070
That seems a bit much this early."

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.190
"We'll talk about this later Honey Bunny."

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.470
"No we won't Angel Cake."

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.660
"Cheddar cheese."

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.850
"Sugar booger."

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:12.850
"Jane."

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:13.850
"Oh!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:14.850
You didn't?"

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:15.850
"Yeah, I did!"

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:16.850
"Well that's it!

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:17.850
Relationship over."

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.620
"Fine, this was a bicycle meant for two Janet!

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.460
For two!"

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:26.220
Given that the pair split up in this deleted
clip, it seems that we were meant to interpret

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:28.750
the final movie's credits scene as them getting
back together.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:33.370
By the way, during their break-up, we can
see how similar they are, when Janet uses

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:37.560
the kind of dramatic word fade that Cloud
Guy liked to use in the first movie.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:42.220
"Janet and Cloud Guy were just doomed to fail.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.260
Fail, fail, fail."

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.330
"Certain death, death, death, death, death...

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:49.430
Broppy fans would have probably enjoyed the
next part of this deleted scene also:

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.970
"But you guys were such a cute couple."

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.020
"Yeah, and we ruined it.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.340
Guess we were just too different.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.000
Hope that doesn't happen with you two."

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.530
"Oh no, no, it's not that...

00:04:58.530 --> 00:04:59.530
See...

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:00.530
We're just friends...

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.530
We're not...
it's just...

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.530
just...
friends...

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.530
just friends.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.530
He's not my boyfriend."

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.530
"Right."

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:09.600
But Cloud romances seem to move pretty quickly
in the Trolls world because Janet has a rebound

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:13.480
already set up with a thunderstorm cloud:
"Well time to move on..

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.050
winds are changing, yada, yada..

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:16.840
Besides my rebound's here.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:17.840
"Rebound?"

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:22.730
"Are any of these guys bothering you?"

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:26.880
With Sheila B popped, the trolls hurtle towards
the ground below.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:31.510
Fortunately though, Poppy finds some gum and
they blow bubbles that act as parachutes helping

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:32.640
them land safely.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:34.930
"I swallowed my gum."

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:35.970
"Eww."

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.940
Next up is a mind-blowing deleted song that
Poppy and Branch sing together as they set

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.940
out their trip around the Troll kingdom on
the Sheila B balloon.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.911
But just before we dive into that I want to
thank the sponsor of this video Full Sail

